                                                "sense_id": "affb6bfb-2836-3dbf-a1d9-5755a81f8f2e",
                                                "text": "Here, Isabel, here is the good gentleman’s handkerchief; keep it for him now, till he comes to see little Bell again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d9c7f40-8741-4714-9d74-9fd16a314189",
                                                "sense_id": "affb6bfb-2836-3dbf-a1d9-5755a81f8f2e",
                                                "text": "[…] I found that her Christian name was Isabella, which they shortened into Bell, and that the name of the deceased non-commissioned officer was Tott. Being the kind of neat little woman it was natural to make a toy of—I never saw a woman so like a toy in my life—she had got the plaything name of Belltott. In short, she had no other name on the island."
                                            }
